        <h1>SAT <span class="accent">Advanced</span> Math Practice</h1>
        <p class="lede">Advanced Math is where the digital SAT stops being linear: quadratics, exponentials, polynomials, and the algebra that rearranges them. It carries about 35 percent of the section, roughly tied with Algebra as the biggest domain, and the hard second module draws on it so heavily that the road to 700 runs straight through this domain.</p>
